### (IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client) — mesma URL, so o header muda

### Tenant A
GET http://localhost:8080/tenant/info
X-Secret-Id: workshop/tenant-a

### Tenant B
GET http://localhost:8080/tenant/info
X-Secret-Id: workshop/tenant-b

### Tenant C (tabela criada no 1o acesso)
GET http://localhost:8080/tenant/info
X-Secret-Id: workshop/tenant-c

### Usuarios do tenant A
GET http://localhost:8080/usuario
X-Secret-Id: workshop/tenant-a

### Usuario 1 do tenant B
GET http://localhost:8080/usuario/1
X-Secret-Id: workshop/tenant-b

### Cadastrar no tenant C
POST http://localhost:8080/usuario
X-Secret-Id: workshop/tenant-c
Content-Type: application/json

{ "usuario": "novo.cliente-c", "email": "novo@cliente-c.com", "senha": "123456" }

### Sem header -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/usuario

### Secret inexistente -> 400
GET http://localhost:8080/usuario
X-Secret-Id: workshop/tenant-x
